  {
   "id": 2,
   "file": "SC002",
   "section": "Cold open",
   "start": 7.625,
   "duration": 5.458,
   "narration": "Then the sky starts to move. One dark shape. Then ten. Then fifty.",
   "visual": {
    "type": "anim",
    "shot": "A01"
   },
   "clip": "../09_Animation/SC002.mp4",
   "audio": "../10_Audio/narration/SC002.wav"
  },
  {
   "id": 3,
   "file": "SC003",
   "section": "Cold open",
   "start": 13.083,
   "duration": 9.042,
   "narration": "Within about half an hour, there's almost nothing left. No smell. No swarm of flies. No disease left lying in the sun.",
   "visual": {
    "type": "plate",
    "shot": "P02",
    "move": "push",
    "fx": [
     "dust"
    ]
   },
   "clip": "../09_Animation/SC003.mp4",
   "audio": "../10_Audio/narration/SC003.wav"
  },
  {
   "id": 4,
   "file": "SC004",
   "section": "Cold open",
   "start": 22.125,
   "duration": 8.708,
   "narration": "For thousands of years, that's how it worked. Then, in the 1990s, the vultures of South Asia started dying.",
   "visual": {
    "type": "plate",
    "shot": "P15",
    "move": "pan_r"
   },
   "clip": "../09_Animation/SC004.mp4",
   "audio": "../10_Audio/narration/SC004.wav"
  },
  {
   "id": 5,
   "file": "SC005",
   "section": "Cold open",
   "start": 30.833,
   "duration": 5.875,
   "narration": "Not slowly. In about ten years, more than ninety-five percent of them were gone.",
   "visual": {
    "type": "card",
    "card": "bignum",
    "value": "\u221295%",
    "label": "South Asia's Gyps vultures, in about a decade",
