   "clip": "../09_Animation/SC047.mp4",
   "audio": "../10_Audio/narration/SC047.wav"
  },
  {
   "id": 48,
   "file": "SC048",
   "section": "Ripples",
   "start": 362.498,
   "duration": 10.667,
   "narration": "For centuries, India's Parsi community has laid its dead in Towers of Silence, open to the sky, where vultures returned the bodies to nature.",
   "visual": {
    "type": "plate",
    "shot": "P20",
    "move": "pan_l"
   },
   "clip": "../09_Animation/SC048.mp4",
   "audio": "../10_Audio/narration/SC048.wav"
  },
  {
   "id": 49,
   "file": "SC049",
   "section": "Ripples",
   "start": 373.165,
   "duration": 10.542,
   "narration": "With the vultures gone, some towers now use solar concentrators instead. They struggle in the monsoon, when the sun disappears behind clouds.",
   "visual": {
    "type": "plate",
    "shot": "P20B",
    "move": "push",
    "fx": [
     "rain"
    ]
   },
   "clip": "../09_Animation/SC049.mp4",
   "audio": "../10_Audio/narration/SC049.wav"
  },
  {
   "id": 50,
   "file": "SC050",
   "section": "Ripples",
   "start": 383.707,
   "duration": 4.333,
   "narration": "Europe ran its own version of the experiment, by choice.",
   "visual": {
    "type": "card",
    "card": "map",
    "country": "ESP",
    "label": "Spain"
   },
   "clip": "../09_Animation/SC050.mp4",
   "audio": "../10_Audio/narration/SC050.wav"
  },
  {
   "id": 51,
   "file": "SC051",
   "section": "Ripples",
   "start": 388.04,
   "duration": 9.583,
   "narration": "After the mad cow crisis, new rules meant dead livestock had to be collected and trucked away, instead of being left out for vultures.",
   "visual": {
    "type": "card",
    "card": "trucks"
   },
   "clip": "../09_Animation/SC051.mp4",
   "audio": "../10_Audio/narration/SC051.wav"
  },
  {
   "id": 52,
   "file": "SC052",
   "section": "Ripples",
   "start": 397.623,
   "duration": 13.333,
   "narration": "One study found those trucks covered nearly fifty million kilometres a year, releasing about seventy-seven thousand tonnes of carbon dioxide. Work the vultures used to do for free.",
   "visual": {
    "type": "card",
    "card": "trucks_numbers",
    "tag": "STRONG"
   },
   "clip": "../09_Animation/SC052.mp4",
   "audio": "../10_Audio/narration/SC052.wav"
  },
  {
   "id": 53,
   "file": "SC053",
   "section": "It's happening again",
   "start": 410.956,
   "duration": 4.458,
   "narration": "And right now, it's happening again. This time in Africa.",
   "visual": {
    "type": "plate",
    "shot": "P21",
    "move": "push",
    "tab": "TODAY \u00b7 Savanna, Africa",
    "text": {
     "style": "chapter",
     "main": "AFRICA, NOW",
