   "clip": "../09_Animation/SC059.mp4",
   "audio": "../10_Audio/narration/SC059.wav"
  },
  {
   "id": 60,
   "file": "SC060",
   "section": "Could anything replace them?",
   "start": 471.58,
   "duration": 9.417,
   "narration": "But none of them do all three things vultures do: spot a carcass from far away, strip it in minutes, and destroy the germs inside it.",
