   "file": "SC064",
   "section": "Holding the line",
   "start": 502.039,
   "duration": 10.875,
   "narration": "India has banned veterinary diclofenac, and in 2023 it banned two more drugs that harm vultures: ketoprofen and aceclofenac.",
