   "file": "SC066",
   "section": "Holding the line",
   "start": 519.497,
   "duration": 12.042,
   "narration": "In Nepal, conservationists opened vulture restaurants: feeding stations stocked with drug-free carcasses. Near some of them, nesting vultures have started to come back.",
   "visual": {
