   "file": "SC067",
   "section": "Holding the line",
   "start": 531.539,
   "duration": 10.0,
   "narration": "Breeding centres are raising vultures in captivity, and conservationists are pushing for vulture-safe zones, where harmful drugs aren't sold.",
